From: LM-G820N Developer <dev@lmg820n.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] qcom: add native LG AWB region preprocessing and gray core

Generate RNC and DTB polygons, luma gates and lux participation scales.
Convert all RGB regions, label exceptions before proportional RNC shifts,
and classify the shifted coordinates. Share nearest-reference selection
and keep the 29 category bins distinct from RNC counters. Compose this
path with scene weights and aggregation into a stateful RGB-to-gray core.

